  "aiContextParagraph": "The political discourse regarding the replacement of the Vice President has intensified, with various Gerindra regional branches and legislative representatives publicly endorsing Sugiono for the role. Discussions currently center on the vacancy left by Gibran, with President Prabowo Subianto expected to lead the selection process. While internal party support for Sugiono is growing, other political figures have also been mentioned as potential candidates, leading to speculation regarding the final choice. The National Mandate Party (PAN) has indicated it may align with the Gerindra-led initiative. To ensure stability during the transition, prospective candidates including Sugiono and Amran are reportedly preparing to sign official statements confirming their commitment to the candidacy. As these developments unfold, regional representatives and various party factions continue to advocate for their preferred candidates, emphasizing the need for leadership capable of representing public interests effectively.",
